WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.248
Question nine.

00:00:01.248 --> 00:00:06.864
Step one: macro scan. It asks the main purpose of data control.

00:00:06.864 --> 00:00:10.429
One mark. Command words: “main purpose”.

00:00:10.429 --> 00:00:12.034
Step two: denoise.

00:00:12.034 --> 00:00:16.134
Useful, in yellow: loan records, data control.

00:00:16.134 --> 00:00:18.273
In cyan: “main purpose”.

00:00:18.273 --> 00:00:22.552
Useless red herring: PE equipment — kick it out.

00:00:22.552 --> 00:00:24.156
Step three: draft.

00:00:24.156 --> 00:00:26.652
Data control in three words:

00:00:26.652 --> 00:00:29.415
accurate, complete, authorised.

00:00:29.415 --> 00:00:32.446
Nothing to do with hardware speed.

00:00:32.446 --> 00:00:33.961
Step four: P O E.

00:00:33.961 --> 00:00:37.527
A, deter borrowing: not a purpose — cut.

00:00:37.527 --> 00:00:42.073
C, raise screen resolution: display hardware — cut.

00:00:42.073 --> 00:00:45.728
D, speed up the clock: performance — cut.

00:00:45.728 --> 00:00:54.017
Step five: sanity check and lock. The one left has all three: accurate, complete, authorised.

00:00:54.017 --> 00:00:56.424
So the correct answer is B.
